   "sar_report_text": "# SUSPICIOUS TRANSACTION REPORT (STR) \u2014 DRAFT FOR FIU-IND\n**Approval status:** READY_FOR_REVIEW  \n**Case:** CASE_90657222 \u00b7 **Alert:** ALT_UPI_0692 (UPI_MULE_CHAIN)  \n**Generated:** 2026-11-08 11:35 UTC \u00b7 **Drafted by:** deterministic-template  \n**Fact check:** 11/11 claims verified \u00b7 **Completeness (5W1H):** 100%\n\n## 1. Decision\n- **Decision:** FILE_STR \u2014 Tier 2 \u2014 Priority\n- **Deterministic risk score:** 76.0 / 100 (HIGH)\n- **Recommended action:** File the STR within the statutory timeline and place the account under enhanced monitoring.\n\n## 2. Subject (Who)\n- **Name:** Charlotte Diallo\n- **Customer ID:** CUST_0166\n- **Account(s):** ACC_CUST_0166_1\n\n## 3. Grounds of Suspicion (Why)\n- **MANY_UNRELATED_PAYERS** [STRONG]: Five or more accounts with no previous relationship paid in within a single day. (see C_NEW_PAYERS)\n- **PERSONAL_ACCOUNT_COLLECTION** [MODERATE]: A personal (non-business) account is collecting money from many unrelated payers. (see C_ACCOUNT_TYPE)\n- **BEHAVIOUR_OUTLIER** [MODERATE]: This activity is far outside the account's own pattern over the previous weeks.\n- **NEW_ACCOUNT_HIGH_ACTIVITY** [MODERATE]: A recently opened account is already moving money for many others. (see C_ACCOUNT_AGE)\n\n## 4. Evidence-Linked Facts (What / When / Where) \u2014 the 24 hours around the alerting transactions\n_Every line below was re-computed from the ledger by the Fact Checker. \u2713 = verified, \u2717 = not supported._\n- [\u2713] The customer's declared occupation is Cryptocurrency Broker.  _(evidence: 1 record(s), C_KYC)_\n- [\u2713] The subject account had been open for 19 days when this activity began.  _(evidence: 2 record(s), C_ACCOUNT_AGE)_\n- [\u2713] The subject account is a personal account.  _(evidence: 2 record(s), C_ACCOUNT_TYPE)_\n- [\u2713] In the month before this activity the account made 10 transactions.  _(evidence: 2 record(s), C_PRIOR_ACTIVITY)_\n- [\u2713] The subject account received \u20b948,088.05 in 5 credits from 5 distinct sender accounts.  _(evidence: 5 record(s), C_INFLOW)_\n- [\u2713] The subject account sent \u20b954,117.10 in 2 debits to 2 distinct beneficiary accounts.  _(evidence: 2 record(s), C_OUTFLOW)_\n- [\u2713] These 7 transactions took place over 18.3 hours.  _(evidence: 7 record(s), C_TIMING)_\n- [\u2713] Funds moved through these channels: CARD, IMPS, UPI.  _(evidence: 7 record(s), C_CHANNELS)_\n- [\u2713] Outgoing payments equalled 113% of the money received in the same period.  _(evidence: 7 record(s), C_PASSTHROUGH)_\n- [\u2713] Within one day, 5 accounts that had never transacted with this account before paid into it.  _(evidence: 5 record(s), C_NEW_PAYERS)_\n- [\u2713] 5 of the credits came via UPI from 5 distinct payer accounts.  _(evidence: 5 record(s), C_UPI)_\n\n## 5. Modus Operandi (How)\nSeveral unrelated individuals transferred small amounts to the subject account through UPI. Shortly afterwards the balance was moved onward to other accounts, leaving little behind. This is consistent with the account being used as a money-mule conduit for scam proceeds.\n\n## 6. Sign-off\n> Draft prepared by SentinelGraph. Under PMLA, the decision to file and the content of any STR must be reviewed and authorised by the Principal Officer. ",
